Transfer_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when owner transfers
│  └── it should move tokens (owner is requiresAuth-shortcircuit)
├── when non-owner transfers without auth grant
│  └── it should revert with Unauthorized
├── when authority grants _update selector to a user
│  └── that user should be able to transfer freely
├── when owner uses transferFrom
│  └── it should succeed under owner auth
└── when non-owner with allowance uses transferFrom but no auth grant
   └── it should revert with Unauthorized
